        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Went this evening for the first time and I was so pleasantly surprised! The store is big, well stocked and clean. And Stephanie has been so amazing, helping us find what we needed for our pup, took her time to explain and find the best solution, she is very knowledgeable and kind. Will definitely return, great store!",
