      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sylvie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116945201525073581933/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLv_bQTLXzamynGP5KJQHLIOkMwzKOdenZWFvhaZJl5xWaA0Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I had such a great experience at this pet store thanks to a young gentleman (Colton I believe is his name) ! He was incredibly friendly, professional, and went above and beyond to help me. Not only did he answer all my questions, but he also gave me excellent advice that really showed how knowledgeable he is about pets and their needs. You can tell he genuinely cares about both the animals and the customers. It’s rare to find someone so patient and helpful, and I left feeling much more\nconfident thanks to his guidance. Huge thank you to Colton—he made my visit a truly positive one!",
        "time": 1755305476,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "dan f",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113041946945854745652/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVPumX_VbU32PxJyvC7zB9T-L55T8mpKMXAdzhHFIkCSE1l2ea4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
