        "text": "I bought my dog a bark collar less then 2 weeks ago,went in to return it and get a refund as it isn't working as my dog still barks for hours.The receipt says 30 days in store refund with original packaging.I was told because its open I can't be refunded.Very disappointed and ill assure to be taking my buissness else where.",
